title: c2c monitor should return undelivered inbox mail on start
updated_at: "2026-07-12T08:09:36Z"
---
`c2c monitor` should return any undelivered mail already sitting in the inbox when it is started, rather than only surfacing messages that arrive after the monitor begins watching. Currently a monitor started while mail is already queued misses that backlog until the next inbox change. On startup it should drain/report the existing undelivered inbox contents first, then continue watching.